# ── macOS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# ── Obsidian session state (user-specific, auto-regenerated) ──────────────────
# workspace.json is intentionally tracked — it sets the default split layout
# for new users opening the vault for the first time.
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/ddb-config.json

# ── User data & vault backups ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.trash/
.vault-backups/
z_Uncategoried/

# ── Python cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
Player-Vault-*.zip
files.json

# ── Claude Code context (local only, never pushed) ───────────────────────────
CLAUDE.md
